{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-11","kind":"proposition","title":"过线上一点作直线的垂线","englishTitle":"To draw a straight line at right angles to a given straight line from a given point on it.","book":1,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","contentId":"euclid-1-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a99ff66f61e3a1d953d0a02f4905421f6351e3375db1822825504bd9db28931","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-11.statement","euclid-1-11.construction.1","euclid-1-11.proof.1","euclid-1-11.construction.2","euclid-1-11.proof.2","euclid-1-11.proof.3","euclid-1-11.proof.4","euclid-1-11.proof.5","euclid-1-11.conclusion","euclid-1-11.historical.1","euclid-1-11.historical.2","euclid-1-11.historical.3","euclid-1-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"221850c8be548078796beb26fa078b44e63709a73d970e6c288f3f9399eb0c7f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To draw a straight line at right angles to a given straight line from a given point on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从直角到给定的直线上划出一条直线。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任于一点上求作垂线。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"经过给定直线上的一个指定点，作一条与这条直线垂直的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31c08d1893aa237eee741336783d923a8e70b9fac7001f784ebcf436743b37b3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be the given straight line, and C the given point on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB是给定的直线, C是给定的点。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a14c7fb85554202da4f12119bdad56c01bd119950f295d8bf49557e51be17e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus it is required to draw from the point C a straight line at right angles to the straight line AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,需要从C点划出一条直角点的直线至AB线的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6efe825d42c923bfd213324ec5d4d508867d8234acfafee3f4c1a51ce77c4d2","citations":["euclid-1-3","euclid-1-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let a point D be taken at random on AC; let CE be made equal to CD; [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] on DE let the equilateral triangle FDE be constructed, [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)] and let FC be joined;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC随机选取D点;CE等于CD;DE等于等边三角形FDE,FC合用; [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)] [[I. 1](/principles/euclid-1-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5a039e36fd2012b7310544752136ecce8e7166ab2ae5d0193b1d4dc4fd0f1093","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the straight line FC has been drawn at right angles to the given straight line AB from C the given point on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,FC线线是直角线划到AB线,从C线的指定点划到AB线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56a9a0f76c67d85323431fa29281ecdf08788fe4858af8be98baae52ffa0266e","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since DC is equal to CE, and CF is common, the two sides DC, CF are equal to the two sides EC, CF respectively; and the base DF is equal to the base FE; therefore the angle DCF is equal to the angle ECF; [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)] and they are adjacent angles."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为DC等于CE,CF是共同的,双方DC,CF等于EC,CF等于双方;底边,DF等于底边,FE;因此,角度DCF等于角度ECF;它们是相邻的角。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1cfc29b865bec702b4056bb69b1423cb86405dabad4f6df63913c78264474107","citations":["euclid-1-def-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, when a straight line set up on a straight line makes the adjacent angles equal to one another, each of the equal angles is right; [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)] therefore each of the angles DCF, FCE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,当一条直线上设置的直线使相邻角等同于对方时,每一个等角都是对的;因此,每个角DCF,FCE是正确的。 [[Def. 10](/principles/euclid-1-def-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a76ef826c5fb0e6a2d13b2e47ba6bc3d33eeb68fafc3a65624bc7fce897196a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line CF has been drawn at right angles to the given straight line AB from the given point C on it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从给定的C点,将第CF线从直角线划至给定的第AB线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e432e38b0000ec6ee99e2e8d764f4fbbb98aaaef6b326a175b8cd06205cc0c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"所求作图完成。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"540c01c192e0fee13863da435f6d2c7ac5d2485ca5fd115bb5166003c3b5c33e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"一直线任于一点上求作垂线。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"经过给定直线上的一个指定点，作一条与这条直线垂直的直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a4f215012fc38e77be77f56970cc82cb783e09bec7eacd02ea269b4120f86b6c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：丁己丙与戊己丙两角形之己丁、己戊两腰等，而己丙同线，丙丁与丙戊两底又等，即两形必等，丁与戊两角亦等〈本篇五〉，丁己丙与戊己丙两角亦等〈本篇八、九〉，则“丁丙己”与“戊丙己”两角必等矣。等即是直角，直角即是垂线〈界说十：角，此后三角形多称形，省文也〉。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：丁己丙与戊己丙两三角形之己丁、己戊两腰等，而己丙同线，丙丁与丙戊两底又等，即两形必等，丁与戊两角亦等〈本篇五〉，丁己丙与戊己丙两角亦等〈本篇八、九〉，则“丁丙己”与“戊丙己”两角必等矣。等即是直角，直角即是垂线〈界说十：角，此后三角形多称形，省文也〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"29fc0f1d7e19d56cb111e3844f1ca4b261adb090344efc13058d429c9c20315b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：庚甲丙与庚丙戊两角形之甲丙、戊丙两线既等，庚丙同线，戊丙庚与甲丙庚两角又等，即甲庚、戊庚两线必等〈本篇四〉；而对同边之甲角、戊角亦等〈本篇四〉，戊既直角，则甲亦直角。是甲庚为甲乙之垂线〈界说十〉。"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：庚甲丙与庚丙戊两三角形之甲丙、戊丙两线既等，庚丙同线，戊丙庚与甲丙庚两角又等，即甲庚、戊庚两线必等〈本篇四〉；而对同边之甲角、戊角亦等〈本篇四〉，戊既直角，则甲亦直角。是甲庚为甲乙之垂线〈界说十〉。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-11.source","contentId":"euclid-1-11","revisionId":"euclid-1-11@raw-2a99ff66f61e3a1d","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"01cd587386ea8a661d3350fa8b527afd71